    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Cantrip.</strong> You learn the Friends cantrip. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it (choose when you take this feat).</p><p><strong>Cunning Diversion.</strong> You can take the Dodge action as a Bonus Action. You can use this benefit a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
